!              H2/O2 mechanism                                                   !
! H. Zhao, C. Yan, Z. Wang, A.W. Jasper, S.J. Klippenstein, Y. Ju, et al.,       !
! High-pressure hydrogen oxidation in N2, CO2, and H2O dilutions up to 100 atm   !
! in a supercritical-pressure jet-stirred reactor, Combust. Flame (2022)           !
! (in preparation).                                                              !
